WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.536
Step 1 is one settings file per
environment, copied from the template,

2
00:00:04.536 --> 00:00:08.549
with every placeholder filled:
the tenant, the ring, the groups,

3
00:00:08.549 --> 00:00:12.720
the Intune application IDs, the
security profile, the workspace,

4
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.576
the in-scope device count from
Intune, the minimum versions,

5
00:00:16.576 --> 00:00:21.062
the acceptable-use categories, and
the authentication authorities.

6
00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:26.000
The settings hold names and IDs only;
the operator signs in as a person.

7
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.708
The kit refuses a file with anything
that looks like a secret, a test or

8
00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:35.912
production file with a placeholder left
in it, and any cloud but GCC or global.

9
00:00:35.912 --> 00:00:39.653
Everything after this is the
same command for both stages;

10
00:00:39.653 --> 00:00:43.300
only the file, the evidence
folder and the tenant change.
